ind":"update","title":"Oct 22 Demo Update — More skill effects incoming! Fun is our #1 priority!!","summary":"Patch NotesDashing freezes enemies along your path for 5 seconds. Dash also leaves an icy trail that slows enemies standing on it by 50% for 5 seconds.Dash chains damage to connected enemies and heals you.Enemies you ignite have a chance to explode when killed.Weapon damage buffed: Bullets have a chance to call down a lightning strike on hit.After reloading: unleash an explosive shockwave all around you.Summon 5 laser drones to fire a synchronized laser sweep, leaving burning trails behind.Call ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:29:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031883","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:38:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1846651706693589","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"announcement","title":"live","summary":"末日＋废土＋机甲！","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:47:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693589","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1846651706688827","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"announcement","title":"【Next Fest Coming Soon】Demo is playable! Join our event！","summary":"Hey everyone! DOOM REIGNITE is live for the October Steam Next Fest — grab the free demo right now to try it out!DOOM REIGNITE is a top-down survivor-style shooter centered around mech transformation.In 2039, viruses and radiation swept across the globe. Civilization collapsed and zombies ran rampant. As the only test subject of the Salvation Project, your unique physiology unlocks the power to transform into a mech. Fight your way through the ruined wastelands to secure humanity’s last hope.The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:53:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1846651706683566","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"【Next Fest Build】DEMO 1.0.1.13 Update — Loads of new weapons added!","summary":"Steam Next Fest is coming! DOOM REIGNITE gets tons of brand-new weapons, and mech skills are unlocked for you to test out early. Come feel that devastating mech firepower!We’re still tweaking the mech energy system and combat feel. Give the current mech build a spin, and look forward to more improvements in future patches.New ContentAdded 2 new weapons: Laser Gun and Gatling GunBalance ChangesYou now earn small amounts of currency by defeating regular enemiesCompleting quests grants talent point","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:29:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1846018067935690","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"Future update roadmap is here — take a look!","summary":"JOIN OUR DISCORD","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T08:21:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935690","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1846018067931982","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"DEMO V1.0.1.7 Update — Hotfix Patch","summary":"Fixed a bug where your position would shift randomly after switching from mech back to human form. Fixed an issue where projectiles would sometimes veer off and deal no damage after transforming into the mech.WELCOME TO JOIN OUR DISCORD.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T02:36:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931982","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1845383656385018","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Update: New Gear & Affixes to Slay Enemies!","summary":"New Weapon AffixesAfter a successful reload, chance to fire a fireball at nearby enemiesKilling ignited enemies boosts your weapon fire rateHits have a chance to unleash a lightning orbDealing damage can restore some ammoAfter multiple consecutive hits, launch a volley of rocketsGain 2 seconds of invincibility after reloadingOn the last bullet in your magazine, fire extra rounds outward in all directionsShots that land have a chance to release 3 homing missiles toward enemiesLevelsNew mid-stage ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T05:51:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1844751498223170","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"Happy Mid-Autumn Festival! Our Demo will get a Major Update","summary":"Hey folks, happy Mid-Autumn Festival! May the moon be full and bright🌕During this holiday, our team has been hard at work preparing a massive new Demo update for DOOM REIGNITE. It’s scheduled to drop before the end of September — stay tuned!If you encounter bugs or have any suggestions to share, come join our DISCORD! We read every piece of feedback and keep polishing the game.If you like what we’re building, please Wishlist us. It means the world to our small indie team.Thank you for your suppo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T02:30:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223170","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1844115010490709","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"update","title":"We’ve locked in the date for the huge DEMO update!","summary":"Hi everyone, we’re the team behind Doom Reignite.We’ve been huge fans of survivor-likes for years, and there’s one thing that always stuck out to us. So many games in this genre boil down to nothing more than stacking stats and grinding hordes. Weapons are just reskins, progression paths feel identical. After a few runs, you figure out the whole formula, and there’s no excitement of discovering something new every single playthrough.That’s why we started Doom Reignite — we wanted to create a dif","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T03:13:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490709","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3899120-1842846814455014","game_id":"steam-3899120","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO1.0.1.3 Updated 丨 Got mechs in the apocalypse！","summary":"Yo, I’m the mech engineer behind Doom Reset!Ever since the demo dropped, I’ve been going through all your comments over and over. There’s one take that’s been stuck in my head ever since I read it: “Surviving the apocalypse by turning into some raging brute and punching zombies? Dude, we’re Homo sapiens. SAPIENS!” …Alright, y’all are 100% right. If you’re gonna survive the end of the world as a human, you do it with tech. The whole punchy brute thing? Scrapped. Done. Gone.So here’s the real deal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T08:29:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455014","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3899120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3899120":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3899120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z"},"4938530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:09Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3899120","app_id":3899120,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"60e06c5ec1ba1fcb30e7d2e41f5067f283be230e9449aa2fc3c958934a992bc3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"This lowpoly top-down survivor shooter focuses on human-mech dual-form combat and weapon affix crafting. Viruses and radiation destroyed civilization, leaving mutated zombies everywhere.\r\nGuns roll random perks: damage, projectiles... Build unique playstyles. Master dual forms and survive.","publishers":[{"name":"火花游戏","creator_clan_account_id":46213312},{"name":"Chengdu Shengming Leyou Network Technology Co., Ltd. "}],"developers":[{"name":"Chengdu Shengming Leyou Network Technology Co., Ltd. "}]},"release":